 "confidence": "medium",
 "notes": "Two key layers like the PC version: on foot and in vehicles. F (enter/exit) switches layer; B switches by hand if out of sync. Vehicle keys (W/S, Space handbrake, RMB aim = L1, LMB fire = L1+R1, E horn, H lights, Q radio wheel, . next station, R cinematic camera) from gtaboom. PC y PlayStation parcialmente de GTA Wiki (Controls for GTA V); el resto son los defaults conocidos de PC (lista de magicgameworld que coincide con GTA V). R en PC recarga y da golpe ligero, igual que Círculo en PS5. Q en PC también es golpe fuerte; se mapea a Cubrirse (R1). Z (ampliar radar) y LALT (rueda de personajes, mantener) comparten la cruceta abajo como en PS5. Las flechas, ENTER y BACKSPACE sirven para manejar el teléfono (cruceta, Cruz y Círculo). M = menú de interacción (solo Online, mantener touchpad). Soltar arma (F9/F10) omitido por teclas reservadas. v0.12: bicycle and aircraft modes (B cycles on foot → car → bike → air; F exits to on foot). Bike: W/Caps Lock pedal (Cross), S/Q brake (L2; FiveM lists S as rear brake on R2, gtaboom says R2 pedals faster, so the safer L2 is used), Shift/Ctrl lean (left stick), Space handbrake/BMX hop (R1), E bell (L3), RMB/LMB drive-by, mouse wheel next weapon (Square). Aircraft: W/S throttle (R2/L2), A/D rudder (L1/R1), numpad 8/5/4/6 pitch and roll (left stick), numpad 7/9 targets, G landing gear + Shift boost (L3), E countermeasures/VTOL/Cargobob hook (D-pad right), Insert weapon camera (R3), wheel next weapon (D-pad left). Fire is uncertain: Cross per GTA Wiki and FiveM (gtaboom says Square); PC Space per gtaboom, LMB per the wiki, so both Space and LMB fire. PC mouse flight (hold LMB) has no equivalent: the mouse stays on the camera. Sources: FiveM controls table (docs.fivem.net/docs/game-references/controls/), GTA Wiki, gtaboom.",
 "sources": [
